:.

// A known local call cannot supply the member interface for every external caller.
:e
fun select(x) = x.a
select({a: 1})
//│ ╔══[COMPILATION ERROR] Resolution error in selection
//│ ║  l.+1: 	fun select(x) = x.a
//│ ║        	                ^^^
//│ ╟── Cannot resolve member 'a' of a value with unknown shape.
//│ ╟── Parameter 'x' admits values of unknown shape.
//│ ║  l.+1: 	fun select(x) = x.a
//│ ║        	           ^
//│ ╟── 'select' is exposed by this compilation unit.
//│ ║  l.+1: 	fun select(x) = x.a
//│ ╙──      	^^^^^^^^^^^^^
//│ ═══[RUNTIME ERROR] This code cannot be run as its compilation yielded an error.

:e
